a-start="2462" data-end="2473"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_68" data-source="" data-orig="Source">Source</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="2476" data-end="2630"><li data-start="2476" data-end="2517"><p data-start="2478" data-end="2517"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_69" data-source="" data-orig="European Medicines Agency">European Medicines Agency</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_70" data-source="" data-orig="EMA">EMA</span>, 2018)</p></li><li data-start="2518" data-end="2568"><p data-start="2520" data-end="2568"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="U.S">U.S</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="Department of Agriculture">Department of Agriculture</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="USDA">USDA</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Database">Database</span></p></li><li data-start="2569" data-end="2630"><p data-start="2571" data-end="2630"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="National Institutes of Health">National Institutes of Health</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="NIH">NIH</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Herbal Supplement Facts">Herbal Supplement Facts</span></p></li></ul><hr data-start="2632" data-end="2635" /><h2 data-start="2637" data-end="2683"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_What_Happens_When_Milk_Thistle_Goes_Bad"></span>4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="What Happens When Milk Thistle Goes Bad">What Happens When Milk Thistle Goes Bad</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p data-start="2685" data-end="2781"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="When expired or improperly stored">When expired or improperly stored</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="milk thistle may lose potency or develop harmful by-products">milk thistle may lose potency or develop harmful by-products</span>:</p><ul data-start="2783" data-end="3158"><li data-start="2783" data-end="2895"><p data-start="2785" data-end="2895"><strong data-start="2785" data-end="2810"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="Silymarin degradation">Silymarin degradation</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="Reduced antioxidant activity">Reduced antioxidant activity</span> (fonte: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="Journal of Pharmacy and Pharmacology">Journal of Pharmacy and Pharmacology</span>, 2014)</p></li><li data-start="2896" data-end="2999"><p data-start="2898" data-end="2999"><strong data-start="2898" data-end="2913"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Rancid oils">Rancid oils</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="Cold-pressed oil oxidizes">Cold-pressed oil oxidizes</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="forming">forming</span> <strong data-start="2950" data-end="2975"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="aldehydes and ketones">aldehydes and ketones</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="which are cytotoxic">which are cytotoxic</span>.</p></li><li data-start="3000" data-end="3158"><p data-start="3002" data-end="3158"><strong data-start="3002" data-end="3020"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="Mycotoxin risk">Mycotoxin risk</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="Moisture exposure may lead to mold growth">Moisture exposure may lead to mold growth</span>, especialmente <strong data-start="3076" data-end="3098"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="Aspergillus flavus">Aspergillus flavus</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="which can produce">which can produce</span> <strong data-start="3118" data-end="3132">aflatoxinas</strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="known liver carcinogens">known liver carcinogens</span>.</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start="3160" data-end="3340"><p data-start="3162" data-end="3340"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="💡 According to a">💡 According to a</span> 2021 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="study in">study in</span> <em data-start="3194" data-end="3208"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="Food Control">Food Control</span></em>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="improperly stored milk thistle seeds showed a">improperly stored milk thistle seeds showed a</span> 3.4% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="contamination rate with detectable aflatoxins in humid conditions above">contamination rate with detectable aflatoxins in humid conditions above</span> 65% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="RH">RH</span>.</p></blockquote><hr data-start="3342" data-end="3345" /><h2 data-start="3347" data-end="3397"><img src="/images/Does-Milk-Thistle-Expire-2-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="wp-image-1141 aligncenter" alt="Does Milk Thistle Expire" width="575" height="575" title="O cardo leiteiro expira? Quanto tempo dura o cardo leiteiro &amp; Como armazená-lo corretamente 5" /></h2><h2 data-start="3347" data-end="3397"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_Best_Storage_Practices_Ideal_Product_Forms"></span>5. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="Best Storage Practices">Best Storage Practices</span> &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="Ideal Product Forms">Ideal Product Forms</span><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 data-start="3399" data-end="3418"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="_Storage_Tips"></span> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="Storage Tips">Storage Tips</span>:<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="3419" data-end="3532"><li data-start="3419" data-end="3453"><p data-start="3421" data-end="345